# _TRIGGERDEMO_DEP_ROLL.scn -- natural takeoff roll/climb driven by real
# LNAV/VNAV (BADA), copied verbatim (same real PAPRA SID waypoints) from the
# proven _KB5GEN_DEP_ROLL_DEP001.scn. TAXIOFF releases the aircraft from the
# taxi/hold state; the 30s-later DELRTE+ADDWPT chain (targeting a real
# downstream SID waypoint at 1500ft/180kt) plus explicit SPD/VS/ALT lets
# BlueSky's BADA performance model run the actual ground-roll acceleration
# and initial climb -- NOT MOVE-approximated physics.
# Call: PCALL _TRIGGERDEMO_DEP_ROLL <acid>
00:00:00.00>TAXIOFF %0
00:00:30.00>%0 DELRTE
00:00:30.00>%0 ADDWPT 16.076637,108.195656 1500 180
00:00:30.00>%0 ADDWPT 16.174444,108.194722 4000 200
00:00:30.00>%0 ADDWPT 16.177222,108.387778 6000 250
00:00:30.00>%0 ADDWPT 16.093333,108.388889 7054 240
00:00:30.00>%0 ADDWPT 15.909444,108.391389 10000 260
00:00:30.00>%0 ADDWPT 15.906944,108.061944 18000 290
00:00:30.00>%0 ADDWPT 15.905833,107.931111 20000 300
00:00:30.00>%0 ADDWPT 15.903333,107.658889 21000 300
00:00:30.00>%0 ADDWPT 15.766667,107.183333 22000 310
00:00:30.00>%0 LNAV ON
00:00:30.00>%0 VNAV OFF
00:00:30.00>%0 SPD 250
00:00:30.00>%0 VS 2000
00:00:30.00>%0 ALT 10000
00:00:30.00>%0 ATALT 1500 PCALL _TRIGGERDEMO_VNAV_ON %0
